OL,3,GNEWSAHow wedding content creators take
OL,4,Ayou from aisle to Insta
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the nerves before the ceremony to
OL,7,Fthe tears of laughter during the best
OL,8,Fman's speech, Jade Burton is
OL,9,Fdocumenting every moment on her
OL,10,Fsmartphone.
OL,12,FThe 22-year-old, from Poole in Dorset,
OL,13,Fis one of a growing number of wedding
OL,14,Fcontent creators - a job that did not
OL,15,Fexist just a few years ago.
OL,17,FShe films and edits social media-ready
OL,18,Fvideos, giving newlyweds a record of
OL,19,Ftheir day just 24 hours after they say
OL,20,F"I do".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
